{"seq":9,"slug":"academic-english","title":"学术英语","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 学术英语 简介\n\n学术英语是连接专业知识与国际学术交流的桥梁。无论是撰写论文、阅读文献、参加学术会议，还是应对标准化考试，掌握学术英语的核心能力都是研究者和高阶学习者不可或缺的基本功。本系列文档从写作、阅读、演讲、研究方法和考试五个维度出发，系统构建学术英语的完整能力体系。\n\n本系列适用于正在准备学术论文写作的研究生和博士生、需要定期阅读英文文献的科研工作者、计划在国际会议上做报告的学者，以及正在备考雅思学术类、托福或 GRE 等标准化考试的考生。具备大学英语六级或同等水平的读者均可从本系列中获益。\n\n第1章**学术写作**聚焦于英文学术论文的核心写作技能，涵盖论文结构搭建、论证逻辑构建、引用与参考文献规范，以及学术文体的语言特征。这是整个系列的基石，帮助读者建立规范、严谨的英文写作习惯。\n\n第2章**论文阅读**探讨如何高效阅读和理解英文学术论文。从论文各部分的结构解析到批判性分析方法，再到文献检索策略和笔记系统的搭建，帮助读者从被动接收信息转变为主动研究者。\n\n第3章**学术演讲**关注学术口头表达能力的培养。从学术会议报告到海报展示，从问答环节的应对技巧到视觉辅助材料的设计，全面覆盖学术场景中的演讲需求。\n\n第4章**研究方法论**从英语视角梳理研究设计、数据收集、分析方法和学术伦理等核心议题。这一章帮助读者用准确的英文术语理解和描述研究过程，为论文写作提供方法论支撑。\n\n第5章**学术考试模块**针对主流学术类英语考试进行专项解析，包括雅思学术类、托福学术模块、GRE 分析写作，以及贯穿各场景的学术词汇积累策略。\n\n推荐学习路径方面，如果以论文写作为首要目标，建议从第1章开始，配合第2章的文献阅读技能同步推进，再扩展到第4章的方法论基础。如果以学术交流为核心需求，可优先学习第3章的演讲技能。备考读者则可直接进入第5章，但建议同时参考第1章和第2章以夯实基础能力。无论哪条路径，学术词汇的积累都应贯穿始终。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"academic-writing","title":"学术写作","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thesis-structure","title":"论文结构设计","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-writing/thesis-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"argument-construction","title":"论证方法与逻辑","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-writing/argument-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"citation-and-reference","title":"引用与参考文献","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-writing/citation-and-reference"},{"seq":4,"slug":"academic-style","title":"学术写作风格","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-writing/academic-style"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"paper-reading","title":"论文阅读","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/paper-reading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paper-anatomy","title":"论文结构解剖","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/paper-reading/paper-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"critical-analysis","title":"批判性分析方法","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/paper-reading/critical-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"literature-search","title":"文献检索技巧","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/paper-reading/literature-search"},{"seq":4,"slug":"note-taking-system","title":"笔记系统构建","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/paper-reading/note-taking-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"academic-presentation","title":"学术演讲","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-presentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conference-presentation","title":"学术会议演讲","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-presentation/conference-presentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"poster-session","title":"海报展示技巧","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-presentation/poster-session"},{"seq":3,"slug":"qa-handling","title":"问答环节应对","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-presentation/qa-handling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"visual-aids","title":"视觉辅助设计","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/academic-presentation/visual-aids"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"research-methodology","title":"研究方法论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/research-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-design","title":"研究设计与框架","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/research-methodology/research-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-collection","title":"数据收集方法","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/research-methodology/data-collection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"analysis-methods","title":"分析方法选择","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/research-methodology/analysis-methods"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ethics-in-research","title":"研究伦理规范","url":"/h/english-learning/academic-english/research-methodology/ethics-in-research"}]},{"